## 2. Parity matrix

### Bucket A — served; mobile renders/acts

| Plugin feature | Endpoint |
|---|---|
| Profile → its sessions, newest first | `GET /api/sessions` (or `/p/<profile>/`) |
| Open session, full history | `GET /api/sessions/{id}/messages` |
| Compose + streamed reply, **Stop** | `POST .../chat/stream` · `/chat` · `POST /v1/runs/{id}/stop` |
| New session with a profile | `POST /api/sessions` |
| Rename / pin / archive / hide | `PATCH /api/sessions/{id}` |
| Delete · Fork / branch | `DELETE /api/sessions/{id}` · `POST .../fork` |
| Parent↔child links, ↳ / ↩ | `parent_session_id`, `_lineage_root_id` |
| Mark read/unread (**write**) | `PATCH {unread}` → `db.set_session_read` |
| Row body: preview, age, counts, tokens, cost | `preview`, `last_active`, `message_count`, `tool_call_count`, cost fields |
| Per-session model lock | `POST /api/sessions/{id}/model` · `GET /api/model/options` |
| Bell / cron | `/api/cron/jobs*` · `/api/cron/fire` |

### Bucket B — gaps, re-sized by C

| Feature | Before | Under C |
|---|---|---|
| Profiles list | no route | ✅ `profiles.list` / `GET /api/profiles` |
| Cross-profile rail | hand-typed | ✅ `GET /api/profiles/sessions/sidebar` (batched, with `profile_totals`) |
| **Avatars** | RPC-only | ✅ `profiles.get_asset` → `{found, mime, size, data:"data:image/png;base64,…"}` (`methods_profiles.py:446-460`) |
| Unread read-back | write-only | ✅ dashboard rows carry `last_read_at` |
| Amber "blocked on you" | unclear | ✅ WS open server→client requests (§2.1) |
| Groups / colours / order / hidden / Apropos | renderer store | ❌ phone-local — needs the layout blob (§6) |

### 2.1 Status dots — the pane's real semantics (grounded, not guessed)

From `plugin.js:1791-1893` and `README.md:108-124`. Priority order, per session, one dot:

| Dot | Means | Source on the phone |
|---|---|---|
| **amber** `needs-input` | a session blocked on you — clarify/approval **pending** | an **open server→client request** on `/api/ws`; replayable via `session.events.since` / `open_requests(sid)` |
| **blue** `working` | mid-turn right now | `session.active_list` / live turn state |
| **emerald** `unread` | activity you have not read | dashboard row watermark (`last_read_at`) — note the **RPC `session.list` projection drops `unread`**, so read it from the dashboard route, not RPC (`plugin.js:47-52`) |
| **none** | nothing waiting | — |

Badge number = `needs-input + unread`, shown at 2+. A profile's dot is the **aggregate of its
sessions**, never its own (`plugin.js:1841-1844`). Emerald can stay quiet on a profile that has never
been read through — the pane is honest about this; so is the app.

### Bucket C — mobile builds it

Expand/collapse a face into its sessions · row geometry · long-press menus (Open, Rename, Colour,
File into group, Sort, Copy id, Apropos, Delete) · multi-select + selection bar · groups as drop
targets · toolbar (bell, **+**, folder, search, filters) · day grouping + 25/page pagination · dot
aggregation · PT-PT strings · theme.

**Search is a trap:** the pane searches server-side over profiles *and* sessions; REST takes only
`source`, exact `title`, `include_children`, `include_hidden`. Filter client-side over the fetched
page and say so, or add one RPC method.

