## 11. Sequencing and gates

- No collision: Cody's remote-access run finished (48m 8s, `logs/CODY-DONE.txt`), tree free → build
  **in place** in the main tree (warm toolchain, keystore, gradle cache).
- Frontier model on planning/gates: **this document is the gate artifact** — it can go to Step5/Opus
  before Cody builds; Cody builds on deepseek-flash.
- Android first, then iOS via EAS. Deliverable = a working APK **installed on the Pixel 8**, not
  "ships".
